                <pre className="overflow-x-auto rounded bg-foreground p-3 text-xs text-background">{`Add these variables in Vercel:
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`}</pre>
